{"overview":"On a train headed for England a group of travelers is delayed by an avalanche. Holed up in a hotel in a fictional European country, young Iris befriends elderly Miss Froy. When the train resumes, Iris suffers a bout of unconsciousness and wakes to find the old woman has disappeared. The other passengers ominously deny Miss Froy ever existed, so Iris begins to investigate with another traveler and, as the pair sleuth, romantic sparks fly.","tagline":"Comedy! Chills! Chuckles! in a Mystery Express!","cast":[{"n":"Margaret Lockwood","c":"Iris Matilda Henderson","p":"/fJYOZdBuBjBd4Gi8yLsnoSaAfB5.jpg","q":"Q269202"},{"n":"Michael Redgrave","c":"Gilbert Redman","p":"/eZsZ11LnWcb89LpY9jjALXhmqSb.jpg","q":"Q318263"},{"n":"Paul Lukas","c":"Dr. Hartz","p":"/uPN8hpMtacoFylb0Ez9j800bilZ.jpg","q":"Q182057"},{"n":"May Whitty","c":"Miss Froy","p":"/xjcKt4OBswpGUSGG0jkgr5fP5r4.jpg","q":"Q240193"},{"n":"Basil Radford","c":"Charters","p":"/vln3y55neDuGhoWw6jjpn3sTwKy.jpg","q":"Q530875"},{"n":"Naunton Wayne","c":"Caldicott","p":"/fDfRq7FGnkaKQVlyfLvtxdA76Rb.jpg","q":"Q530921"},{"n":"Cecil Parker","c":"Eric Todhunter","p":"/bKRahLwOtk2EPYrE50zGjeZYsIO.jpg","q":"Q1052329"},{"n":"Linden Travers","c":"'Mrs.' Margaret Todhunter","p":"/puioVV6iqtIJDnQdqcfQihGwbsb.jpg","q":"Q4355279"},{"n":"Mary Clare","c":"Baroness Isabel Nisatona","p":"/uvRGDhYEg7jAOUoh00yiozgWnSw.jpg","q":"Q3296162"},{"n":"Emile Boreo","c":"Boris the Hotel Manager","p":null,"q":null}],"country":["United Kingdom"],"language":["French"],"wiki":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Lady_Vanishes_%281938_film%29","qid":"Q500044","rel":{"AU":{"d":"2011-03-30","c":"PG"},"BR":{"d":"2000-01-01","c":"12"},"DK":{"d":"1940-09-03","c":"11"},"FR":{"d":"2008-07-02"},"GB":{"d":"1938-10-07","c":"U"},"HU":{"d":"1947-03-13","c":"12"},"JP":{"d":"1976-11-20","c":"G"},"SE":{"d":"1939-07-13","c":"15"},"US":{"d":"1938-11-01","c":"NR"}},"backdrops":["/lAk9GRNvXIDrOZtt7Hvvlg0tkXx.jpg","/gufoea6Ylj15Gjer1gwjhbiNOBf.jpg","/dZJNEQYNJ9D6lOJ